abstract: >-
  Machine-only historical-digital scholarly edition of Matthäus Steffel's
  Tarahumarisches Wörterbuch (1791/1809 documentary horizon) and reference
  implementation of the reusable Rarámuri Histórico Digital (RHD)
  data/provenance model. The corpus preserves source/OCR evidence,
  AI-assisted diplomatic and documentary layers, explicit uncertainty,
  TEI and TEI Lex-0 projections, IIIF links, appendices, and computational
  diachronic candidate evidence. No human linguistic or philological
  validation is claimed by release 1.0.0.
keywords:
